  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "都市設計與活化策略",
    "sub_ename": "THE URBAN DESIGN AND REVITALIZATION STRATEGIES",
    "describe_ch": "都市設計是關於如何圍塑城市特質的設計思考過程，學生可在本課程習得關於城市設計的相關知識，特別是如何活化舊城區的觀點。都市設計與活化策略涉及許多跨領域的策略，學生可以透過案例分析以及小組專案報告的方式來涉略這些相關知識及提出相應策略觀點。",
    "describe_eh": "Urban design is about the design thinking process of designing and shaping the features of cities. In this course, Students will learn the knowledge of urban design, especially the perspectives of how to revitalize the old urban districts. There are lots of interdisciplinary strategies related to urban design and revitalization. Students can involve these information by case studies and try to bring out some issues by team work project practices.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
